// Source closure of the recovered classic ESP32 Wi-Fi stack.
// Names resolve program-wide (non-strict imports), so every file that defines a
// function or table the recovered Wi-Fi/radio/lwIP code calls has to be part of
// the program. Importing this file from wifi.ab keeps wifi-connect self-contained
// without pulling in the whole platform_full_esp32.ab profile.
